div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ca-offcanvas-overlay\"></div>\r\n<!-- offcanvas end -->\r\n    \n\r\n\r\n\r\n<main>\r\n    <!-- breadcrumb area start -->\r\n    <!-- breadcrumb area end -->\r\n    <!-- about section start -->\r\n    <section class=\"ca-about-3 travlink-about-story pt-100 pb-70\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 mb-30\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ca-ab-iner p-relative z-index-1\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ca-iner-review-text p-absolute theme-bg-3\">\r\n                            <h3 class=\"ca-counter-title fnw-700 pb-16\"><span class=\"counter\">25</span>K+</h3>\r\n                            <span>Clients Positive Reviews</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"row\">\r\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-30\">\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-iner-img wow img-custom-anim-left\" data-wow-duration=\"1.5s\" data-wow-delay=\".2s\">\r\n                                    <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"/img/about/abtus1.png\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-30\">\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-iner-img ca-ab-iner-img-2 wow img-custom-anim-left\" data-wow-duration=\"1.5s\" data-wow-delay=\".4s\">\r\n                                    <img class=\"w-100 mt-60\" src=\"/img/about/abtus2.png\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 mb-30\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ca-ab-content3\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ca-about-content-3 ca-sec-content-3\">\r\n                            <span class=\"travlink-about-heading__eyebrow\">Who We Are</span>\n                            <h2 class=\"travlink-about-section-title\">\n                                Connecting Asia Through <em>Travel, Trade &amp; Shipping</em>\n                            </h2>\n                            <div class=\"travlink-about-story__copy pt-16 pb-32\">\r\n                                <p>It started the way most things like this do—with a favour. Someone needed a Qatar visa handled properly and had nowhere reliable to turn. Then someone else needed a supplier in China they could actually trust. Then a family needed a holiday planned without the usual runaround.</p>\r\n                                <p>There was no company name yet. No office. No website. Just someone who kept getting asked, and kept saying yes.</p>\r\n                                <p>Over five-plus years, that turned into a real practice—visas for Qatar, Kuwait, and the wider GCC; sourcing trips between Indian buyers and manufacturers in China and Vietnam; and travel planned for families, couples, and business teams. All of it grew through word of mouth, without a storefront.</p>\r\n                                <p>Travlink Global is what happens when that quiet, referral-only practice finally gets a name, a platform, and a front door. We didn't start as an idea looking for a market—we're an experience that's simply stepping into the open.</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ca-ab-item-check\">\r\n                            <!-- single-item -->\r\n                            <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item\">\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-ic\">\r\n                                    <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-content\">\r\n                                    <h4 class=\"ca-item-ch-title\">International Travel & Visa Assistance</h4>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <!-- single-item -->\r\n                            <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item\">\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-ic\">\r\n                                    <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-content\">\r\n<h4 class=\"ca-item-ch-title\">\r\n                    Supplier Sourcing & Factory Visits\r\n                </h4>                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <!-- single-item -->\r\n                            <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item\">\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-ic\">\r\n                                    <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-content\">\r\n<h4 class=\"ca-item-ch-title\">\r\n                    Trusted Logistics & Shipping Coordination\r\n                </h4>                                  </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <!-- single-item -->\r\n                            <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item\">\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-ic\">\r\n                                    <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"ca-ab-sngle-item-content\">\r\n<h4 class=\"ca-item-ch-title\">\r\n                    Strong Business Network Across Asia\r\n                </h4>                                 </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"ca-about-3-btn\">\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n    <!-- about section end -->\r\n\r\n    <!-- why we are section start -->\n    <section class=\"ca-about-3 travlink-about-values pt-100 pb-70\" aria-labelledby=\"travlink-why-we-are-title\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"travlink-why-we-are\">\n                <div class=\"travlink-why-we-are__intro wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.2s\" data-wow-delay=\".1s\">\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-we-are__eyebrow travlink-about-heading__eyebrow\">Why We Are</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"travlink-about-section-title\" id=\"travlink-why-we-are-title\">Built to Make International <em>Travel, Trade &amp; Shipping Simpler</em></h2>\n                    <div class=\"travlink-why-we-are__copy\">\n                        <p>We built Travlink Global because we kept watching the same story repeat—someone pays for a visa, a shipment, or a trip, and then spends weeks chasing updates that never come, over-explaining themselves to agents who go quiet right after the invoice is paid.</p>\n                        <p>We didn't think that was good enough, so we decided to do something about it.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"travlink-why-we-are__practice\">\n                    <h3 class=\"wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".16s\">What That Looks Like in Practice</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"travlink-why-we-are__list\">\n                        <li class=\"wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1s\" data-wow-delay=\".2s\">\n                            <span class=\"travlink-why-we-are__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\n                            <p><strong>One point of contact, start to finish</strong>—no passing you between departments.</p>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1s\" data-wow-delay=\".26s\">\n                            <span class=\"travlink-why-we-are__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\n                            <p><strong>Real answers, not automated replies.</strong></p>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1s\" data-wow-delay=\".32s\">\n                            <span class=\"travlink-why-we-are__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\n                            <p><strong>Visas, sourcing, and shipping</strong>—handled under one roof.</p>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1s\" data-wow-delay=\".38s\">\n                            <span class=\"travlink-why-we-are__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\n                            <p><strong>Clear timelines and pricing</strong> before you commit to anything.</p>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1s\" data-wow-delay=\".44s\">\n                            <span class=\"travlink-why-we-are__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i></span>\n                            <p><strong>We stay involved until it's actually finished</strong>—not just booked, not just paid for.</p>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- why we are section end -->\n    <!-- choose section start -->\r\n    <section class=\"travlink-why-choose\" aria-labelledby=\"travlink-why-choose-title\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <header class=\"travlink-why-choose__header wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.2s\" data-wow-delay=\".1s\">\r\n                <span class=\"travlink-why-choose__eyebrow travlink-about-heading__eyebrow\">Why Choose Travlink Global</span>\n                <h2 class=\"travlink-about-section-title\" id=\"travlink-why-choose-title\">Why Businesses &amp; Travelers <em>Choose Travlink Global</em></h2>\n                <span class=\"travlink-why-choose__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\r\n            </header>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"travlink-why-choose__grid\">\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".1s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z\"/><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.8-5\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Professional Service</h3><p>Every enquiry handled with care and follow-through.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".16s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3c2.2 2.5 3.4 5.5 3.4 9S14.2 18.5 12 21M12 3c-2.2 2.5-3.4 5.5-3.4 9S9.8 18.5 12 21\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Global Network</h3><p>Contacts across Asia, the Gulf, and beyond.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".22s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 13v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2\"/><path d=\"M4 13H2v5h4v-5H4ZM20 13h2v5h-4v-5h2ZM18 18c0 2-2 3-5 3\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Trusted Support</h3><p>Real people, real answers &mdash; not automated replies.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".28s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 3 1.2 3.8L17 8l-3.8 1.2L12 13l-1.2-3.8L7 8l3.8-1.2L12 3ZM19 14l.8 2.2L22 17l-2.2.8L19 20l-.8-2.2L16 17l2.2-.8L19 14ZM5 13l.7 1.8 1.8.7-1.8.7L5 18l-.7-1.8-1.8-.7 1.8-.7L5 13Z\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Personalized Solutions</h3><p>No two clients get the same template.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".34s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8 8 0 0 1-8.5 8L7 22v-3.3A8 8 0 1 1 21 11.5Z\"/><path d=\"M8 10h8M8 14h5\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Transparent Communication</h3><p>Clear pricing, clear timelines, no surprises.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".4s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 20v-2a5 5 0 0 1 5-5h2a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v2M16 4a3 3 0 0 1 0 6M17 13a5 5 0 0 1 4 5v2\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Customer-Focused Approach</h3><p>Your requirement comes first, always.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n                <article class=\"travlink-why-feature wow tpFadeInUp\" data-wow-duration=\"1.1s\" data-wow-delay=\".46s\">\r\n                    <span class=\"travlink-why-feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7Z\"/><path d=\"M22 2 11 13\"/></svg></span>\r\n                    <div><h3>Reliable International Assistance</h3><p>Support that doesn't stop at the border.</p></div>\r\n                </article>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n    <!-- choose section end -->\n\n\r\n</main>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <footer class=\"travlink-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"travlink-footer__top\">\n            <div class=\"travlink-footer__brand\">\n                <a class=\"travlink-footer__logo\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Travlink Global home\">\n                    <span class=\"travlink-footer__logo-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-globe\"></i></span>\n                    <span>Travlink Global</span>\n                </a>\n                <p class=\"travlink-footer__description\">Connecting people and businesses across borders through trusted travel, trade, and shipping solutions.</p>\n                <div class=\"travlink-footer__socials\" aria-label=\"Social media links\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-instagram\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"X\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-x-twitter\"></i></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"travlink-footer__column\" aria-label=\"Footer quick links\">\n                <h2>Quick Links</h2>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/about/\">About</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/travel/\">Travel</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/trade/\">Trade</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/shipping/\">Shipping</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </nav>\n\n            <nav class=\"travlink-footer__column\" aria-label=\"Footer